NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000127 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000128 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000129 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000130 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000131 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000132 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000133 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000134 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000135 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000136 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000137 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000138 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000139 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000140 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000141 "Dist::Zilla plugin and/or Pod::Weaver::Plugin. Any additional steps required"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000142 "beyond that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
